#: ../../source/reference/meshcollider.rst:13
msgid ""
"The MeshCollider class provides a way to create a collider based on a 3D "
"mesh. The collider can be attached to a physics world, and its "
"properties, such as the mesh, material, and enabled state, can be "
"manipulated dynamically."
msgstr ""

